{"book":"psalms","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T03:41:32.170566998Z","verse":3,"ref":"psalms 17:3","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":17,"translation":"You tested my heart, You visited ⟨it⟩ in the night; You refined me, You found nothing; my purpose is not — that my mouth should transgress.","tokens":[{"surface":"בחנת","gloss":"You tested"},{"surface":"לבי","gloss":"my heart"},{"surface":"פקדת","gloss":"You visited"},{"surface":"לילה","gloss":"in the night"},{"surface":"צרפתני","gloss":"You refined me"},{"surface":"בל","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תמצא","gloss":"You find"},{"surface":"זמתי","gloss":"I am resolved"},{"surface":"בל","gloss":"will not"},{"surface":"יעבר","gloss":"transgress"},{"surface":"פי","gloss":"my mouth"}]}